        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Forlorn Howl"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, emotion, fear, mental)\n\nDesert's Howl vents a long and desolate wail full of nightmares and despair. The devastating howl can be heard up to 1 mile away under the open sky. Any creature who hears it experiences a sudden sinking in its stomach and heart palpitations, its hair stands on end, and it must attempt a 38 Will save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected and becomes temporarily immune for 1 hour.\n- **Success:** The creature becomes frightened 2.\n- **Failure:** The creature becomes frightened 3.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature becomes doomed 1, frightened 4, and is fleeing for 1 round."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "three_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "0ce06f17-052f-4289-a1be-2aaaee68846e",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:21.437399"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Illusory Ambush"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Desert's Howl shimmers with illusions and devastates a foe who lost track of its position. Desert's Howl Strides up to twice its Speed. If it ends its movement within its melee reach of at least one enemy to which it's undetected, it can attempt two claw Strikes against that enemy. These attacks count toward Desert's Howl's multiple attack penalty, but the multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after Desert's Howl makes both of these attacks. Desert's Howl remains undetected to the creature it's attacking until after resolving both of the claw attacks."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
